b.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107788.patch","merged_at":"2025-06-23T14:50:27Z"},"body":"I've been working on a script to parse `gdextension_interface.h` (which is something a number of language bindings do!) and in the process I've discovered some minor errors and inconsistencies.\r\n\r\nThese include:\r\n\r\n- Incorrect argument names in doc comments\r\n- Forgetting information after `@return`\r\n- Putting trailing docs after interface function definitions, when we have a whole doc block above it\r\n- Using raw function pointer types in structs or as arguments, rather than `typedef`ing a type for them\r\n\r\nNone of these are functional changes - only cosmetic. But just to be sure, I've run the godot-cpp tests using this modified header in both Godot and godot-cpp. Everything still works :-)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107788/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/10778